     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Compatible interface Wiggins ferrules"
      photoshop:LayerText="Compatible interface Wiggins ferrules"/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="  Technical data   Axiforma semibold 7 pt / Axiforma Regular 7 "
      photoshop:LayerText="  Technical data   Axiforma semibold 7 pt / Axiforma Regular 7 pt Proof pressure: 250 psi / 17,2 bar Burst pressure: 375 psi / 25,8 bar Flexure capability: 28.000 per 3 Â° flexure Axial movement: Up to + 1/8 inch from initially centred. Flexibility: (Max. angular misalignment) Â± 4 Â° total angular tube flexure) Electrical bonding: (Resistance) Conforms to MIL-85087class SA (&lt; 1 ohm) Qualification specification: MIL-C-22263 elected to suit the application Seals: Uses standard AS568 O-Ring sizes provided by user, with O-Ring material s Operating temperature: -120Â°F to +800Â°F / -80Â°C to 400Â°C  (dependingon coupling material) "/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Wiggins Clamshell Couplings are quick-release couplings specifi"
      photoshop:LayerText="Wiggins Clamshell Couplings are quick-release couplings specifically engineered for use with low to medium pressure applications (operating at 125 PSI) involving fabricated aluminum, water, oil, and air. These couplings boast a unique clamp design that accommodates angular misalignment of up to +/- 4Â° and allows a total axial movement of 6.35mm with rigid pipe or tube assemblies. Supaero maintains a consistently high stock level and offers a variety of compatible weld ferrules, sleeves, and lightweight fittings expressly designed to seamlessly connect with Wiggins Couplings. We also specialize in crafting tailored solutionsâ€”please reach out to us for custom requirements. These couplings conform to the rigorous standards of military and aerospace specifications, meeting both AS1650 and MIL-C-22263. "/>
     <rdf:li
      photoshop:LayerName="Supaero provides Adel Wiggins quick-release couplings designed "
      photoshop:LayerText="Supaero provides Adel Wiggins quick-release couplings designed for connecting hard tubes to flexible hoses ranging from 0.5&quot; to 4&quot; in outer diameter. Widely used in motorsport, aerospace, marine, and industrial settings, these connectors can be operated single-handedly and incorporate locking latch designs, eliminating the necessity for safety wire and significantly saving time in critical situations. They are suitable for applications with low to medium pressure, with an operating limit of 125 PSI. Weld ferrules are offered in AN-08 to AN-64 fitments, allowing for tailored fittings. O-Rings are necessary for use and are available separately. "/>
